        "original_id": "ad20bee6-a31a-5c37-95e0-0f798cf2da87",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sigourney Weaver, William Friedkin, Chevy Chase, Gregory Hines\n- Products: Annie Hall, Alien, Aliens, Alien 3, Alien Resurrection, Deal of the Century\n- Concepts: Alien film series, Academy Award for Best Actress\n\nFacts:\n- Sigourney Weaver made her film debut as a minor character in Annie Hall in 1977.\n- Sigourney Weaver rose to prominence with her first lead role as Ellen Ripley in Alien in 1979.\n- Deal of the Century is a 1983 American comedy film directed by William Friedkin and starring Chevy Chase, Gregory Hines, and Sigourney Weaver.\n- Sigourney Weaver reprised Ellen Ripley in Aliens in 1986 and received an Academy Award for Best Actress nomination for that performance.\n- Sigourney Weaver reprised Ellen Ripley again in Alien 3 in 1992.\n- Sigourney Weaver reprised Ellen Ripley in Alien Resurrection in 1997.\n- Alien Resurrection is the fourth installment in the Alien film series and the final installment in the original series.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "145cdfee-de21-5465-8b21-a48d656ccb9d",
        "text": "Page: Sigourney Weaver. Sentence: Following her film debut as a minor character in \"Annie Hall\" (1977), she quickly came to prominence with her first lead role as Ellen Ripley in \"Alien\" (1979).\nPage: Sigourney Weaver. Sentence: She reprised the role in three sequels: \"Aliens\" (1986), for which she was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Actress; \"Alien 3\" (1992), and \"Alien Resurrection\" (1997).\nPage: Alien Resurrection. Sentence: It is the fourth installment in the \"Alien\" film series, and the final installment in the original series.\nPage: Deal of the Century. Sentence: Deal of the Century is a 1983 American comedy film directed by William Friedkin and starring Chevy Chase, Gregory Hines, and Sigourney Weaver.",
